# Observed SDL2 installation

What this library was verified against. It is a record of an installed package
rather than a vendored tree: SDL2 comes from the system, and nothing here is a
copy of its source.

pkg-config --modversion sdl2   2.32.10
pkg-config --libs sdl2         -lSDL2
header                         /usr/include/SDL2/SDL.h

The include path pkg-config reports is not used. SDL2's headers also sit at
their package-qualified path under a default search directory, so a wrapper
including <SDL2/SDL.h> needs no include directory, which is what lets this
library declare an interface of one link input and nothing else.
